{"chunk_id": "e962aaebb8828467", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "background-tasks", "evidence_id": "background-tasks#返回后执行任务", "source_path": "background-tasks.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/background-tasks/", "source_title": "Background Tasks", "section_title": "返回后执行任务", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "FastAPI 可以在响应返回后运行小型后台任务，例如写日志或发送通知。适合用于客户端不必等待完成的轻量操作；接口可以先返回结果，再执行任务。"}
{"chunk_id": "8289a82f4c1bafbd", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "background-tasks", "evidence_id": "background-tasks#声明和添加任务", "source_path": "background-tasks.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/background-tasks/", "source_title": "Background Tasks", "section_title": "声明和添加任务", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "在路径操作中声明 `BackgroundTasks` 参数，然后用 `add_task` 注册函数及其参数。任务函数可以是普通函数或异步函数，FastAPI 会负责在响应流程之后调用它。"}
{"chunk_id": "8b211da6134c977a", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "background-tasks", "evidence_id": "background-tasks#任务范围", "source_path": "background-tasks.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/background-tasks/", "source_title": "Background Tasks", "section_title": "任务范围", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "后台任务适合短小、与当前进程资源相关的工作。重量级计算或需要跨进程、多机器调度的任务应考虑任务队列等外部系统，而不是把所有工作塞进单个 Web 进程。"}
{"chunk_id": "a8b1c48f3c7ee804", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "body-nested-models", "evidence_id": "body-nested-models#列表字段", "source_path": "body-nested-models.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/body-nested-models/", "source_title": "Body Nested Models", "section_title": "列表字段", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "Pydantic 模型字段可以声明为 `list[str]`、`set[str]` 等带元素类型的容器。FastAPI 会根据模型定义解析和校验请求体，并在 API 文档中展示字段类型。"}
{"chunk_id": "96f38343669b4df1", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "body-nested-models", "evidence_id": "body-nested-models#嵌套模型", "source_path": "body-nested-models.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/body-nested-models/", "source_title": "Body Nested Models", "section_title": "嵌套模型", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "一个 Pydantic 模型可以把另一个模型作为字段类型。例如 `Item` 可以包含可选的 `Image`，而 `Offer` 可以包含一组 `Item`。嵌套模型支持编辑器提示、数据转换、校验和自动文档生成。"}
{"chunk_id": "0e263529590c5fb0", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "body-nested-models", "evidence_id": "body-nested-models#多层请求体", "source_path": "body-nested-models.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/body-nested-models/", "source_title": "Body Nested Models", "section_title": "多层请求体", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "路径参数、query 参数和 Pydantic 请求体可以同时出现在一个路径操作中。FastAPI 会根据参数是否出现在路径、是否是简单类型或是否是 Pydantic 模型，分别从路径、查询字符串或 JSON body 中读取。"}
{"chunk_id": "8c4465eb3c4d3b39", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "dependencies", "evidence_id": "dependencies#依赖注入的作用", "source_path": "dependencies.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/", "source_title": "Dependencies", "section_title": "依赖注入的作用", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "FastAPI 的依赖注入允许路径操作声明自己需要的公共逻辑，例如共享查询参数、数据库连接或权限检查。框架会调用依赖函数，并把返回值传给路径操作；同一个依赖可以被多个接口复用。依赖的参数声明和校验也会进入 OpenAPI 文档。"}
{"chunk_id": "3a74976c062a420e", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "dependencies", "evidence_id": "dependencies#使用-depends", "source_path": "dependencies.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/", "source_title": "Dependencies", "section_title": "使用 Depends", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "可以用 `Depends` 声明一个依赖函数。依赖函数的参数仍然按照普通 FastAPI 参数规则解析，例如 query 参数和类型校验。路径操作只接收依赖返回的结果，不需要手动调用依赖函数。"}
{"chunk_id": "0f33ca2b6e02c540", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "dependencies", "evidence_id": "dependencies#依赖与安全", "source_path": "dependencies.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/", "source_title": "Dependencies", "section_title": "依赖与安全", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "依赖注入可以承载认证、授权、角色检查和共享资源管理。把权限检查放在依赖中，可以让多个接口共享同一套规则，同时保持请求参数和接口文档的一致性。"}
{"chunk_id": "9f39b571eb25b23d", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "first-steps", "evidence_id": "first-steps#最小应用", "source_path": "first-steps.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/first-steps/", "source_title": "First Steps", "section_title": "最小应用", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "一个最简单的 FastAPI 应用先从 `from fastapi import FastAPI` 导入类，再用 `app = FastAPI()` 创建应用实例。使用 `@app.get(\"/\")` 等路径操作装饰器把 URL 路径和 HTTP 方法映射到 Python 函数；函数返回的字典可作为 JSON 响应。"}
{"chunk_id": "9b66626b27487518", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "first-steps", "evidence_id": "first-steps#自动交互式文档", "source_path": "first-steps.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/first-steps/", "source_title": "First Steps", "section_title": "自动交互式文档", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "启动开发服务器后，默认可以在 `/docs` 查看由 Swagger UI 提供的交互式 API 文档，也可以在 `/redoc` 查看另一套文档界面。FastAPI 会根据 API 自动生成 OpenAPI schema，默认可通过 `/openapi.json` 查看原始 JSON 描述。"}
{"chunk_id": "33f2499aa83c9ef3", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "first-steps", "evidence_id": "first-steps#openapi-的用途", "source_path": "first-steps.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/first-steps/", "source_title": "First Steps", "section_title": "OpenAPI 的用途", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "OpenAPI schema 描述 API 的路径、参数以及输入和输出数据结构。它为自动交互式文档提供依据，也可用于生成与 API 通信的客户端代码，例如前端、移动端或 IoT 客户端。"}
{"chunk_id": "82cda603432b029d", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "first-steps", "evidence_id": "first-steps#路径操作", "source_path": "first-steps.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/first-steps/", "source_title": "First Steps", "section_title": "路径操作", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "路径是 URL 中主机名之后的路由部分，例如 `/items/foo`；操作指 HTTP 方法，例如 GET、POST、PUT 或 DELETE。路径操作装饰器（例如 `@app.get(\"/\")`）把路径和方法关联到其下方的函数。GET 通常用于读取，POST 通常用于创建，PUT 用于更新，DELETE 用于删除；这些是常见约定，FastAPI 不强制每个方法只能用于某个目的。"}
{"chunk_id": "ea4ca44db38a82b2", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "handling-errors", "evidence_id": "handling-errors#httpexception", "source_path": "handling-errors.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/handling-errors/", "source_title": "Handling Errors", "section_title": "HTTPException", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "在路径操作中需要向客户端报告 HTTP 错误时，可以从 FastAPI 导入并抛出 `HTTPException`。例如查找不到资源时抛出 `HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Item not found\")`，客户端会收到 404 和包含 detail 的 JSON 错误响应。"}
{"chunk_id": "b8ba5e58af272883", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "handling-errors", "evidence_id": "handling-errors#抛出异常而不是返回异常", "source_path": "handling-errors.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/handling-errors/", "source_title": "Handling Errors", "section_title": "抛出异常而不是返回异常", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "`HTTPException` 是 Python 异常，因此应使用 `raise`，而不是 `return`。抛出异常会立即终止当前请求处理，即使它发生在路径操作调用的工具函数中，FastAPI 也会将对应 HTTP 错误返回客户端。"}
{"chunk_id": "8cd7e5e646840d4c", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "handling-errors", "evidence_id": "handling-errors#自定义错误详情", "source_path": "handling-errors.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/handling-errors/", "source_title": "Handling Errors", "section_title": "自定义错误详情", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "`HTTPException` 的 `detail` 可以是任何能够转换为 JSON 的值，不限于字符串，也可以是字典或列表。构造异常时还可以附加 HTTP 响应头。"}
{"chunk_id": "f66abd479acaf66f", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "handling-errors", "evidence_id": "handling-errors#自定义异常处理", "source_path": "handling-errors.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/handling-errors/", "source_title": "Handling Errors", "section_title": "自定义异常处理", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "可以使用 `@app.exception_handler()` 为自定义异常注册全局处理函数。FastAPI 也允许覆盖默认异常处理器，包括请求校验异常处理器；`RequestValidationError` 与请求数据校验失败有关，可按需要定制它的响应。"}
{"chunk_id": "fb15804436175e22", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "middleware", "evidence_id": "middleware#请求和响应的公共处理", "source_path": "middleware.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/middleware/", "source_title": "Middleware", "section_title": "请求和响应的公共处理", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "中间件会包裹每个请求：它可以在路径操作执行前读取或修改请求，在路径操作完成后处理响应，然后把响应返回给客户端。适合用于请求计时、日志、统一响应头或跨请求的通用逻辑。"}
{"chunk_id": "39ab83965c4d1af3", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "middleware", "evidence_id": "middleware#使用边界", "source_path": "middleware.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/middleware/", "source_title": "Middleware", "section_title": "使用边界", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "中间件作用于整个应用或匹配范围内的请求，因此不应把只属于某一个接口的业务规则全部放进中间件。需要依赖注入、参数校验或接口级权限时，应优先使用路径操作和依赖系统。"}
{"chunk_id": "a7df27b41d03e601", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "query-parameters", "evidence_id": "query-parameters#参数自动识别", "source_path": "query-parameters.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/query-params/", "source_title": "Query Parameters", "section_title": "参数自动识别", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "路径函数中，已经出现在 URL 路径里的参数会被识别为路径参数；其他函数参数会被解释为查询参数（query parameter）。查询参数位于 URL 的问号 `?` 之后，多个键值对用 `&` 连接，例如 `/items/?skip=0&limit=10`。"}
{"chunk_id": "68b4be74f0b4f7c0", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "query-parameters", "evidence_id": "query-parameters#默认值与可选参数", "source_path": "query-parameters.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/query-params/", "source_title": "Query Parameters", "section_title": "默认值与可选参数", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "查询参数可以设置默认值，因此可以不出现在请求 URL 中。例如 `skip: int = 0` 和 `limit: int = 10` 在省略时分别使用 0 和 10。若 URL 只提供 `skip=20`，未提供的 `limit` 仍使用默认值 10。将参数默认值设为 `None` 可使其可选。"}
{"chunk_id": "82c78c5a49c47bf5", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "query-parameters", "evidence_id": "query-parameters#类型转换与校验", "source_path": "query-parameters.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/query-params/", "source_title": "Query Parameters", "section_title": "类型转换与校验", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "给查询参数声明 Python 类型后，FastAPI 会把 URL 中的字符串值转换为相应类型，并进行校验。例如把 `short` 声明为 `bool` 后，`short=1`、`short=True`、`short=true`、`short=on` 或 `short=yes` 都可解析为 True；类型声明也支持编辑器提示和自动文档。"}
{"chunk_id": "f7c3cecf74086a71", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "query-parameters", "evidence_id": "query-parameters#必填查询参数", "source_path": "query-parameters.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/query-params/", "source_title": "Query Parameters", "section_title": "必填查询参数", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "非路径参数若没有默认值就是必填查询参数；设置默认值（包括 `None`）则不是必填。函数签名中的类型和默认值共同决定 FastAPI 如何解析参数、是否允许省略以及如何验证输入。"}
{"chunk_id": "e3feda58e84180db", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "request-body", "evidence_id": "request-body#使用-pydantic-声明请求体", "source_path": "request-body.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/body/", "source_title": "Request Body", "section_title": "使用 Pydantic 声明请求体", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "客户端需要向 API 发送数据时，可以把数据放在请求体（request body）中。FastAPI 通常使用继承自 Pydantic `BaseModel` 的类声明请求体结构，再把该模型类型声明为路径操作函数的参数。模型字段可使用标准 Python 类型。"}
{"chunk_id": "77d4550b68523358", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "request-body", "evidence_id": "request-body#模型字段是否必填", "source_path": "request-body.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/body/", "source_title": "Request Body", "section_title": "模型字段是否必填", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "Pydantic 模型字段没有默认值时是必填字段；设置默认值后字段可省略。将字段默认值设置为 `None` 可以表达可选字段。FastAPI 会把请求 JSON 映射到模型字段，并在 OpenAPI schema 和交互式文档中展示模型结构。"}
{"chunk_id": "0a40e7d3a874d52b", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "request-body", "evidence_id": "request-body#请求体解析与校验", "source_path": "request-body.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/body/", "source_title": "Request Body", "section_title": "请求体解析与校验", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "使用模型类型声明请求体后，FastAPI 会读取 JSON 请求体、在需要时转换类型、校验数据，并把解析后的模型对象交给函数。如果输入无效，会返回指出错误位置和内容的校验错误；模型类型还提供编辑器类型提示。"}
{"chunk_id": "837fc0d22acbecd7", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "request-body", "evidence_id": "request-body#请求体与-http-方法", "source_path": "request-body.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/body/", "source_title": "Request Body", "section_title": "请求体与 HTTP 方法", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "发送请求体常用 POST，也可以用于 PUT、DELETE 或 PATCH。GET 请求携带请求体在规范中行为未定义；FastAPI 虽支持极少数复杂场景，但不鼓励这样做，Swagger UI 也不会显示 GET 请求体文档，且中间代理可能不支持。"}
{"chunk_id": "1d69c43b717641a4", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "response-model", "evidence_id": "response-model#返回模型的作用", "source_path": "response-model.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/response-model/", "source_title": "Response Model", "section_title": "返回模型的作用", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "路径操作可以通过 `response_model` 声明响应数据的模型。FastAPI 会使用它生成文档、校验返回值，并把输出转换和过滤为模型允许的字段。"}
{"chunk_id": "9088e09f38a6018c", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "response-model", "evidence_id": "response-model#输出过滤", "source_path": "response-model.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/response-model/", "source_title": "Response Model", "section_title": "输出过滤", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "响应模型不仅用于说明返回类型，也能避免把内部字段直接暴露给客户端。即使路径操作返回一个包含额外字段的字典，响应仍会按照声明的模型过滤和序列化。"}
{"chunk_id": "4ee2fab225599630", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "response-model", "evidence_id": "response-model#与类型标注的关系", "source_path": "response-model.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/response-model/", "source_title": "Response Model", "section_title": "与类型标注的关系", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "返回值类型标注可以同时帮助编辑器和 FastAPI 理解接口输出。需要区分普通返回类型标注与显式 `response_model` 的用途；后者适合在输入类型和输出类型不同，或需要明确控制公开字段时使用。"}
{"chunk_id": "ed2e8fb36731e10f", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "response-status-code", "evidence_id": "response-status-code#设置响应状态码", "source_path": "response-status-code.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/response-status-code/", "source_title": "Response Status Code", "section_title": "设置响应状态码", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "可以在路径操作装饰器上通过 `status_code` 参数声明响应 HTTP 状态码，例如 `@app.post(\"/items/\", status_code=201)`。它是 `get`、`post` 等装饰器方法的参数，不是路径操作函数的参数。FastAPI 会返回该状态码，并在 OpenAPI schema 中记录它。"}
{"chunk_id": "14a7671d8ead9a24", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "response-status-code", "evidence_id": "response-status-code#常见状态码", "source_path": "response-status-code.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/response-status-code/", "source_title": "Response Status Code", "section_title": "常见状态码", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "200 表示成功，也是常见默认状态码；201 表示已创建，常用于创建新记录；204 表示无内容，响应不应包含 body。400 到 499 表示客户端错误，例如 404 表示未找到；500 到 599 表示服务端错误。"}
{"chunk_id": "9b6cada58822bf6f", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "response-status-code", "evidence_id": "response-status-code#状态码常量", "source_path": "response-status-code.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/response-status-code/", "source_title": "Response Status Code", "section_title": "状态码常量", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "可以直接传入数字，也可以使用 `fastapi.status` 提供的常量，例如 `status.HTTP_201_CREATED`。常量值与对应数字相同，并可借助编辑器自动补全查找。"}
{"chunk_id": "a9eb40d169c48a6e", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "security-first-steps", "evidence_id": "security-first-steps#bearer-token-入门", "source_path": "security-first-steps.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/security/first-steps/", "source_title": "Security First Steps", "section_title": "Bearer token 入门", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "FastAPI 的安全工具可以从 `Authorization` 请求头读取 Bearer token。缺少该请求头或格式不符合要求时，框架会直接返回 401；符合格式时，路径操作可以收到 token 字符串。"}
{"chunk_id": "829c48903f79d7b0", "project": "fastapi_docs", "version": "frozen-v2", "doc_id": "security-first-steps", "evidence_id": "security-first-steps#这一步不等于完整认证", "source_path": "security-first-steps.md", "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/security/first-steps/", "source_title": "Security First Steps", "section_title": "这一步不等于完整认证", "chunk_index": 0, "text": "读取 token 和校验 token 是两个步骤。基础安全依赖只负责提取并检查请求格式，不能自动证明 token 的签名、有效期或用户权限。生产系统还需要接入实际的认证服务和授权规则。"}
